A column-zero definition ends an open list item

```
1. x
[t](u)
_u_
[r]: /u
[t][r]
\#
.
<ol>
  <li>x
<a href="u">t</a>
<u>u</u>
[r]: /u
[t][r]
#</li>
</ol>
```

```
- a
[^f]: note
after[^f]
.
<ul>
  <li>a
[^f]: note
after[^f]</li>
</ul>
```

```
